  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal Control Review (ISK) of Sweden Mission Council (SMR) 2020</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Revision (ISK) av Svenska missionsr&#xe5;det 2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The assignment aims to support Sida&#x2019;s appraisal for a new agreement with SMC for 2022-2026. As such, and in view of the information already available to CIVSAM, it focuses less on the internal control environment of SMC itself, and more on the funding flow downstream through SMC&#x2019;s partners.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uppdraget syftar till att st&#xf6;dja Sidas bed&#xf6;mning inf&#xf6;r ett nytt avtal med SMR f&#xf6;r 2022-2026. Med tanke p&#xe5; den information som redan finns tillg&#xe4;nglig f&#xf6;r CIVSAM, fokuserar uppdraget mindre p&#xe5; den interna kontrollmilj&#xf6;n f&#xf6;r SMR sj&#xe4;lv, och mer p&#xe5; finansieringsfl&#xf6;det nedstr&#xf6;ms genom SMR:s partner.</narrative>
  </description>
